。\n摄影风格：大场景和人物特写\n剪辑风格：城市宣传片剪辑节奏。\n（无配乐，无字幕。）\n生成内容：\n画面描述： 镜头跟随女孩的脚步在艺术跑步环道上。特写脚步落地，路边的悦动装置随着步伐亮起灯光。镜头穿梭于人才文化走廊，捕捉晨练老人对弈的专注神情，女孩边跑步边跟遇到的人微笑，打招呼。\n• 声音/文案： （环境音）有节奏的跑步声，轻快的背景音乐渐起。（女孩旁白）\"这里是活力的聚集场，每一步都踏在城市的脉搏上。\"\n• 画面包装： 镜头运动轨迹线化作动态线条，勾勒出\"一廊一环\"的布局图，随即消散融入风景。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "title": "分镜提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [575.6141357421875, 355.0877990722656], "pos": [1334.6527099609375, -318.82135009765625], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "video", "links": [2], "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"name": "video_url", "links": [3], "label": "video_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "video_url"}, {"name": "response", "links": [4], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}, {"name": "pid", "label": "pid", "type": "SORA_PID", "localized_name": "pid"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["", "landscape-hd", 1145300211, "randomize", 15], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 65, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 13, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "link": 66, "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration_seconds"}, "shape": 7, "name": "duration_seconds", "label": "duration_seconds", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "duration_seconds"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_Sora2_I2V", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [400, 244], "pos": [2105.585693359375, -209.24655151367188], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {